id: 24
hanzi: 傍晚
pinyin: bàng wǎn
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: towards evening; dusk; nightfall; twilight; sunset
  es: al atardecer; al anochecer; crepúsculo; atardecer; caída de la tarde

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | the period of the day when the sun is setting and darkness begins to fall; twilight | momento del día en que el sol se pone y cae la noche; crepúsculo | 傍晚时分 (at dusk / around twilight)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 每当傍晚来临，夕阳将整片洋面染成金红，全家人便站在帆船甲板上静静欣赏这壮丽的日落。 | Měi dāng bàngwǎn láilín, xīyáng jiāng zhěng piàn yángmiàn rǎn chéng jīnhóng, quán jiārén biàn zhàn zài fānchuán jiǎbǎn shàng jìngjìng xīnshǎng zhè zhuànglì de rìluò. | Whenever dusk arrived and the setting sun dyed the ocean gold and crimson, the family stood on deck quietly admiring the majestic sunset. | Al caer el atardecer y teñir el sol poniente el mar de dorado y grana, la familia contemplaba en silencio la grandiosa puesta de sol desde la cubierta.
  #2 | 气象监测站通常在每天傍晚汇总全天的卫星云图数据，为港口作业船只提供精准的夜间通航预报。 | Qìxiàng jiānkèzhàn tōngcháng zài měitiān bàngwǎn huìzǒng quántiān de wèixīng yúntú shùjù, wèi gǎngkǒu zuòyè chuánzhī tígōng jīngzhǔn de yèjiān tōngháng yùbào. | The meteorological station aggregates satellite cloud imagery every evening at dusk, delivering accurate nocturnal transit forecasts for harbor vessels. | La estación meteorológica consolida al anochecer las imágenes satelitales de la jornada para emitir partes precisos de navegación nocturna para los buques del puerto.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
